# FLINTHOLD: the island map. The first time, the story; then Pim stands at
# Hearthome. Roads lead on from home and from cleared stages only; after the
# first stage the road forks to The Coil and Fernbrake. Two
# villages are hidden: walk off Palm Spring (once cleared) the way the sea
# looks empty for the Scale Camp (the second village: the Beacon), and off
# The Tangle for Far Isle.
game flinthold
wait 20
expect state == 0
press A
wait 5
expect state == 1
wait 25
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 5
expect state == 2
expect story_seen == 1
expect node == 10
press RIGHT
wait 20
expect node == 0
# stage 2 is shut until stage 1 is cleared
press UP
wait 20
expect node == 0
expect open2 == 0
cheat clear 1 1
expect open2 == 1
# First Tracks opens both The Coil and Fernbrake
expect open3 == 1
press RIGHT
wait 20
expect node == 2
press DOWN
wait 20
expect node == 0
press UP
wait 20
expect node == 1
# Palm Spring opens from Ashflats only, not from Sky Scare
cheat clear 8 1
expect open6 == 0
cheat clear 4 1
expect open6 == 1
# the hidden road off Palm Spring needs Palm Spring cleared
cheat node 6
press DOWN
wait 20
expect node == 5
expect found == 0
cheat clear 6 1
press DOWN
wait 20
expect node == 11
expect found == 1
expect goals & 1
# Far Isle, off The Tangle
cheat node 9
cheat clear 9 1
press RIGHT
wait 20
expect node == 12
expect found == 3
# A plays the stage Pim stands on; B goes back to the title
cheat node 1
wait 12
press A
wait 2
expect state == 3
expect level == 1
cheat map
wait 12
press B
wait 2
expect state == 0
